# The fixes of the review of step 23 (the interactive application): the
# rules the review found untested or broken, broken one at a time, with
# the tests that must fail. Written with the code.

[break] a-hang-up-is-a-read-error
rule: The terminal closing under a read (end of input, EIO) ends the application as SIGHUP's end, exit code 129, while signals are handed to it.
